[[3,63,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>It is not possible to order a\nsingle lock barrel or to order barrels simply by using a part code.</p><p>When\nordering barrels, observe the special procedure set out in  \n                                                         <a href=\"#/2891982\">5580E</a></p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Remove the retaining clip.</p><p>2. Insert the key in the lock barrel and remove.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035621.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the lock barrel\nis undamaged.</p><p>1. Check that the seal is undamaged.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035622.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p>Fit the retaining clip into\nits seat.</p><p>Fit the lock barrel into its seat until\nthe groove engages with the retaining clips.</p>"]]